✅ Why daily quizzing boosts brain activity and confidence', '<!--StartFragment--><h1 style="font-size: 1.7rem; background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgb(122, 13, 31), rgb(200, 16, 46)) text; margin-bottom: 4px; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;">🎥 Brain Over Boredom</h1><p style="margin: 0px 0px 8px; color: rgb(26, 26, 26); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 600;">Turn Your Free Time Into Pocket Money with QuizArena</p><p class="intro" style="margin: 8px 0px; font-size: 1.02rem; background: rgb(255, 246, 246); border: 1px solid rgb(243, 213, 217); padding: 12px 16px; border-radius: 10px; color: rgb(26, 26, 26); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;">Hey everyone! Today I\'m showing you&nbsp;<b>QuizArena</b>&nbsp;— a quiz platform where students compete in fast, fair General Knowledge sprints, earn points, and convert them into&nbsp;<b>real prize money</b>. It\'s a fun way to boost your brain, and a genuine help for students who need pocket money and a reason to stay sharp with their studies.</p><h2 style="font-size: 1.15rem; margin-top: 34px; margin-bottom: 6px; border-left: 4px solid rgb(200, 16, 46); padding-left: 10px; color: rgb(26, 26, 26); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;">🧩 Step 1: Pick a Contest</h2><p style="margin: 8px 0px; color: rgb(26, 26, 26); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium;">Open the&nbsp;<b>Contests</b>&nbsp;tab. Each card shows the prize pool, entry fee, and open spots — choose&nbsp;<b>Free Entry</b>&nbsp;if you\'re new, or&nbsp;<b>Paid Entry</b>&nbsp;for higher stakes.</p><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Contest Lobby" style="width: 556.8px; max-width: 700px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224); box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08) 0px 2px 8px; margin: 10px 0px 4px; display: block; color: rgb(26, 26, 26); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"><div class="caption" style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); margin-bottom: 6px; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;">📸 The Contest Lobby — Free and Paid contest cards side by side.</div><h2 style="font-size: 1.15rem; margin-top: 34px; margin-bottom: 6px; border-left: 4px solid rgb(200, 16, 46); padding-left: 10px; color: rgb(26, 26, 26); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;">🏆 Step 2: Check the Prize Breakup &amp; Join</h2><p style="margin: 8px 0px; color: rgb(26, 26, 26); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium;">Every contest clearly lists Rank 1 (Gold Scholar), Rank 2 (Silver Scholar), and Rank 3 (Bronze Scholar) rewards, plus your balance — tap&nbsp;<b>Join Contest</b>&nbsp;to lock your spot.</p><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Contest Detail and Prize Breakup" style="width: 556.8px; max-width: 700px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224); box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08) 0px 2px 8px; margin: 10px 0px 4px; display: block; color: rgb(26, 26, 26); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"><div class="caption" style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); margin-bottom: 6px; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;">📸 Contest detail page — Spot Status, Entry Fee, and Prize Breakup.</div><h2 style="font-size: 1.15rem; margin-top: 34px; margin-bottom: 6px; border-left: 4px solid rgb(200, 16, 46); padding-left: 10px; color: rgb(26, 26, 26); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;">🤖 Step 3: Attend the Quiz — Fairly</h2><p style="margin: 8px 0px; color: rgb(26, 26, 26); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium;">This is the key part: QuizArena runs&nbsp;<b>active AI proctoring</b>&nbsp;during every quiz. Copy-paste is blocked, tab-switching is flagged, and only genuinely valid, independently-answered responses earn points. No cheating, no shortcuts — just real knowledge, rewarded fairly.</p><h2 style="font-size: 1.15rem; margin-top: 34px; margin-bottom: 6px; border-left: 4px solid rgb(200, 16, 46); padding-left: 10px; color: rgb(26, 26, 26); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;">💰 Step 4: Track Points &amp; Prize Balance</h2><p style="margin: 8px 0px; color: rgb(26, 26, 26); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium;">Every correct answer adds points instantly. Head to&nbsp;<b>My Wallet</b>&nbsp;to see Total Points, Today\'s Points, Prize Balance, and your progress toward the next cash reward.</p><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Wallet Overview" style="width: 556.8px; max-width: 700px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224); box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08) 0px 2px 8px; margin: 10px 0px 4px; display: block; color: rgb(26, 26, 26); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"><div class="caption" style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); margin-bottom: 6px; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;">📸 My Wallet — points, prize balance, and target reward progress.</div><h2 style="font-size: 1.15rem; margin-top: 34px; margin-bottom: 6px; border-left: 4px solid rgb(200, 16, 46); padding-left: 10px; color: rgb(26, 26, 26); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;">🎁 Step 5: Withdraw Your Prize Money</h2><p style="margin: 8px 0px; color: rgb(26, 26, 26); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium;">Check your&nbsp;<b>Points History</b>, then use the&nbsp;<b>Withdraw Prize Money</b>&nbsp;form to cash out via UPI once you hit the target.</p><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Points History and Withdraw" style="width: 556.8px; max-width: 700px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224); box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08) 0px 2px 8px; margin: 10px 0px 4px; display: block; color: rgb(26, 26, 26); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"><div class="caption" style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); margin-bottom: 6px; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;">📸 Points History tab with the Withdraw Prize Money form below.</div><h2 style="font-size: 1.15rem; margin-top: 34px; margin-bottom: 6px; border-left: 4px solid rgb(200, 16, 46); padding-left: 10px; color: rgb(26, 26, 26); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;">🧠 Why It Matters</h2><p style="margin: 8px 0px; color: rgb(26, 26, 26); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium;">For students struggling to stay motivated or short on pocket money, QuizArena turns spare minutes into brain-boosting practice — and real, fairly-earned rewards.&nbsp;<b>Join a contest, play fair, earn points, grab the prize!</b>&nbsp;🎉</p><!--EndFragment-->', 'http://localhost:5000/uploads/4adee28a-655b-4c24-a2d3-3a77de85b27a.png', 'general', 'vlog', 'NA', '', 1, 0, '1bb4baf1-10e5-4fd2-bdd0-0b7be5da8365', '2026-09-04 06:04:36.149', '2026-09-04 06:08:50.000');
